; S59 - transcendental libm across ISAs. macOS libSystem vs Android bionic
; are different implementations; transcendentals are not IEEE-754
; correctly-rounded, so last-ULP drift is permitted by the spec.
; Number::Float displays via {:?} (shortest round-trip) so identical text
; <=> identical f64 bits. Harness ULP-sensitivity verified in ulp_probe.metta.
!(sin-math 0.1)
!(sin-math 0.5)
!(sin-math 1.0)
!(sin-math 1.5707963267948966)
!(sin-math 2.0)
!(sin-math 3.141592653589793)
!(sin-math 3.5)
!(sin-math 7.0)
!(sin-math 10.0)
!(sin-math 100.0)
!(sin-math 1000.0)
!(sin-math 12345.6789)
!(sin-math 1000000.0)
!(sin-math 1000000000000000.0)
!(sin-math 0.9999999999999999)
!(sin-math 1e-08)
!(sin-math 2.718281828459045)
!(sin-math 1.4142135623730951)
!(sin-math 0.7853981633974483)
!(sin-math 6.283185307179586)
